Hey friends! Did you know that just like superheroes have powers, girls in India have rights that make them super special? Yep, it's true! Let's chat about some cool things that every girl should know.

Every girl has the superpower to go to school for free until she's 14! Thanks to the Right to Education Act, learning is like a fantastic adventure for all.

Girls can be health superheroes! They have the right to see doctors, eat yummy and nutritious food, and live in a happy and healthy environment. The government has cool plans to make sure girls and their moms stay strong and healthy.

Guess what? In India, we have a rulebook called the Constitution that says no one can treat girls differently just because they're girls! Fair play is the name of the game at school, work, and in all the fun stuff we do.

Girls have a cool superpower to say what's on their minds and join in all the fun activities in their neighborhoods. It's like being a social superhero, with the right to vote and be part of the community buzz.

No to Early Marriages Super Rule: There's a super rule called the Prohibition of Child Marriage Act that says girls have the right to choose when they want to get married. No rush, they get to decide!

Safety Shield Superforce: Every girl deserves to feel safe and protected. Laws are like superhero shields against bad things like violence, abuse, and exploitation. We want every girl to be a superhero and live in a safe and secure world.

Inheritance Treasure Hunt: Girls can be treasure hunters too! They have the right to inherit property, making sure they have the power of money and independence.

Privacy Shield Super Cloak: In the age of gadgets and gizmos, every girl gets a super cloak for privacy. No one can peek into their private lives without permission, it's a rule!

Choice Champions: Girls are the bosses of their own lives! They get to choose what they want to study, where they want to work, and who they want to be friends with. It's all about being the captain of your own ship.

So, there you have it, our superhero guide to girls' rights in India! Let's spread the word, be superheroes for equality, and make sure every girl gets to live an awesome life full of opportunities and adventures. You rock!